? Develop and improve standardized, streamlined and efficient data related operations processes with Sales Management
? Drive and assist with the production of reports upon local Sales Management request
? Attend/participates in relevant business/market related meetings/calls and supports in production of client facing report as per required
? Learns and supports other technology tools if/as required by business needs
? Cross function communication, to collect/verify/analyze data from different resource and direction
? Complete any other duties as per required by local Sales Management
职位要求：
Preferred candidate would be/possess:
? Experiences in analyzing and transforming large sets of data into deliverables catered to both the business and sales platform
? Well-organized individual with very high attention to detail
? Sound understanding of data quality controls and processes.
? Excellent interpersonal skills, able to interact professionally at all levels.
? Communication skills.
? Ability to manage own workload, effectively prioritize and work to deadline with minimum supervision.
