- Maintain master data for POS system accurate and updated;
- Help sales prepare PPT presentation on business tracking, analysis and insights;
Business Planning
- Assist making yearly contract and Letter of Authorization;
- Follow up weekly & monthly sales target planning;
Sales Supporting
- Collect sales weekly travel schedule and reimbursement;
Provide other ad-hoc support if needed.
REQUIREMENTS
