- Excellent communication skills in English and Mandarin
- Strong Microsoft Office skills on Excel and PPT, Power Query and Power Pivot preferred;
- Number sensitive, detailed-oriented, self-motivated and teamwork spirit;
- Fluent in English and Mandarin;
- Excellent communication and problem solving ability.', 'open', NULL);
